c seed tag set (35 tags including 'ambiance' and 'automation' which were removed) and does not include 'qanewtag' or 'mood-lighting', so the new tag cannot be selected as a filter choice.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created product with new tags 'qatag1, qatag2'; tags appeared on detail page as product.tags collection, and searching 'qatag1' returned the product.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited Philips Hue Starter Kit tags from 'lighting, smart-home, ambiance, automation' to 'lighting, smart-home, mood-lighting, qanewtag' (add+rename+remove). Detail page product.tags collection showed exactly ['lighting','smart-home','mood-lighting','qanewtag']; keyword search for 'qanewtag' returned the product.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Changed Philips Hue Starter Kit category from Home Goods to Fitness via admin edit form; product then appeared under /category/fitness (4 items incl. it) and was removed from /category/home (2 items, no longer listed). Reverted back to Home Goods successfully.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Selecting 'Tech Gadgets' in the category filter on /products updated count to '4 products found' and grid showed exactly QA Test Gadget Pro, Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra, MacBook Pro 14, Sony WH-1000XM5 - all Tech category products.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All 10 products in /products grid each show: image, name, category badge (Tech/Home/Fitness), price, star rating value, brief description paragraph, and a 'Buy Now' purchase link to an external retailer URL.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort 'Price: Low