ished and visible to visitors\", \"actual\": \"Created a product with only Name and Short Description filled (no image, no affiliate link, no full review, no specifications, price left at default $0). The admin form accepted and saved it without validation error, and it immediately appeared publicly on /products ('Incomplete QA Product', 11 products found, listed with $0 price, presumably missing image/retailer link). There is no distinct publish/draft state or validation preventing an incomplete record from being shown to visitors.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/nonexistent-product-xyz showed a not-found screen with 'Browse All Products' link and no product data. /category/invalidcat showed heading 'Category Not Found' with message \\\\\\\"The category you're looking for doesn't exist.\\\\\\\" and no unrelated product listing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All sort/filter/search changes (category select, sort select, search text, tag toggles, price slider, rating select) updated products.grid and products.count in-place immediately without any page navigation or reload being required, observed across category filter, search, sort, price/rating filters, and tag filters.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each product card has two separate links (image link and name/heading link) both pointing to the same /product/{slug} URL, e.g. Sony WH-1000XM5's image link and name link both target /product/sony-wh-1000xm5. Clicking the QA Test Gadget Pro product link earlier correctly navigated to its detail page.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking 'Buy Now' on Sony WH-1000XM5 opened a new browser tab navigating to https://example.com/sony-xm5, an external retailer domain matching the product's affiliate link.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category filter dropdown value updated to 'Tech Gadgets' and product grid updated in-place to show only the 4 tech products, without page reload/URL navigation prompt.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sony WH-1000XM5 detail page shows name, category (Tech), rating (4.8), price ($399), brief description, full untruncated review paragraph, 4 tags, 5 key specifications, image, and Buy Now retailer action - all matching the product record.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Seeded products use relevant category/tag values consistently, e.g. Sony WH-1000XM5 (Tech; tags headphones/wireless/noise-cancelling/premium), verified identical on /products grid, /category/tech, and detail page.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sony WH-1000XM5: name/category/price/rating/description identical across products grid ($399,4.8,Tech) and detail page. Detail page 'My Review' paragraph showed the complete 5-sentence review text with no truncation/ellipsis, and all 5 specifications were listed in full.\"}]}"
